{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SUPER ADVENTURE is a 2D-Platformer with great emphasis on bullet dodging, expressive boss fights and a wacky story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADVENTURE START</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your sleep was interrupted by aliens that destroyed your house, so you head out to find them. On your way you are given an irreplaceable item that holds great importance on your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE SHIELD:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always active on <strong>your</strong> <strong>backside</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn around</strong> to block</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Protects you from <strong>all attacks</strong> coming your way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/pagegifnewnew-ezgif.com-gif-maker.gif?t=1748974076\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Additionally SUPER ADVENTURE can be mainly played in <strong>two different</strong><i> styles</i>.</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE SWORD:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sword focuses on close quarter combat and features a juggle and combo system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/sowrdgid.gif?t=1748974076\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE GUN:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gun charges itself by hitting enemies, causing it to level up. Not hitting anything for a certain amount of time will cause the gun to slowly  lose its charge until it reaches level 1 again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/gunlevel1transparent.gif?t=1748974076\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LEVEL 1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/gunlevel4-ezgif.com-gif-maker.gif?t=1748974076\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAX LEVEL</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578820?t=1748974076","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/02374436bf724d0aee85c16250e6dea04f5b4d03/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748974076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/0e64cb4f96516d5eb341268925a4133338afd8fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748974076","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/0e64cb4f96516d5eb341268925a4133338afd8fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748974076","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SUPER ADVENTURE is a 2D-Platformer with great emphasis on bullet dodging, expressive boss fights and a wacky story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADVENTURE START</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your sleep was interrupted by aliens that destroyed your house, so you head out to find them. On your way you are given an irreplaceable item that holds great importance on your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE SHIELD:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always active on <strong>your</strong> <strong>backside</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn around</strong> to block</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Protects you from <strong>all attacks</strong> coming your way</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/pagegifnewnew-ezgif.com-gif-maker.gif?t=1748974076\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Additionally SUPER ADVENTURE can be mainly played in <strong>two different</strong><i> styles</i>.</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE SWORD:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sword focuses on close quarter combat and features a juggle and combo system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/sowrdgid.gif?t=1748974076\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE GUN:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gun charges itself by hitting enemies, causing it to level up. Not hitting anything for a certain amount of time will cause the gun to slowly  lose its charge until it reaches level 1 again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/gunlevel1transparent.gif?t=1748974076\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LEVEL 1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578820/extras/gunlevel4-ezgif.com-gif-maker.gif?t=1748974076\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAX LEVEL</strong></p>","developers":["Nicolas Duggert","Kerris Dunkel"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.ste